<div class="section top-section"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-2-columns hero-v1"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-shape-wrapper"><div class="shape"></div><div class="shape"></div><div class="shape _01 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape shape-photo reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape"></div><div class="shape _02 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape _03 reveal-on-scroll"><div class="circle-shape"></div></div><div class="shape _04 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape _05 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape _06 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape shape-photo-2 reveal-on-scroll"></div><div class="shape _07 reveal-on-scroll"><div class="circle-shape"></div></div></div><div class="inner-container _500px _100-tablet reveal-on-scroll" id="w-node-_9a5409d1-a131-328f-9b14-aa7caf8f1bb4-6e67ad71"><h1 class="display-1 mg-bottom-12px">The Tormont 50</h1><p class="mg-bottom-24px">A consultancy group built for boards, CEOs, and investors. We don’t just measure performance — we create alignment, resolve disconnects, and design strategies that build long-term shareholder trust and value.</p><div class="buttons-row"><a class="btn-primary button-row w-button" href="/about"><span class="line-rounded-icon link-icon-right">Start Discovery </span></a><a class="btn-secondary w-button" href="/contact">Contact us</a></div><div class="divider _40px"></div><div class="grid-text---logo-social"><div class="heading-h5-size" id="w-node-e229a72f-2e99-4c13-5c81-95e0e1be4647-6e67ad71">Follow us on social media</div><div class="w-layout-grid social-media-grid-top right mbp-align-left"><a class="social-icon-square w-inline-block" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/thetormont50page/" target="_blank"><div class="social-icon-font"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
